
### J1  Shell  joins.md  Fetch referenced fields via multi_search
# joins.md lines 36-46 on typesense-website master
    curl "http://localhost:8108/multi_search" -X POST \
            -H "X-TYPESENSE-API-KEY: ${TYPESENSE_API_KEY}" \
            -d '{
                  "searches": [
                    {
                      "collection": "books",
                      "include_fields": "$authors(first_name,last_name)",
                      "q": "famous"
                    }
                  ]
                }'
$ HOME="/c/tmp/docs302-verify/evidence/joins" TYPESENSE_API_KEY=xyz sh "/c/tmp/docs302-verify/evidence/joins/j1.sh" 2>&1 | grep -oE '"error":"[^"]*"|"found":[0-9]*|"authors":\{[^}]*\}'
"error":"No search fields specified for the query."
